n County has 75 years of record on 6 grids, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 189% of normal in May to June and 48% in November to December. All 6 grids had their driest year in 2007, with grid 17568 at 59%. Grid 17570 shows a preliminary August to September 2026 estimate of 78.1, an estimate from NOAA rain that RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ from.</p>"}
